      "original_viewed": true,
      "notes": "可见溪流旁道路、工程机械和石块堆积。画质偏模糊，石块与路面边界还需局部复核；不能仅因源类别为道路损坏就认定道路实体障碍。",
      "image_file": "D:\\drone-agent-data\\p6-ai-verification-20261018\\ladi-pilot\\images\\a52637f7257e78ad.jpg",
      "image_sha256": "2c1a6809a08e241193c5e341276b4156ae7c8f02148478cd95025fe7be2b091c"
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "ladi-1ca134b198cea5b0",
      "original_viewed": true,
      "notes": "倾斜航拍包括住宅道路、上方高速路和受损林木。整幅未立即显示明确的目标内障碍，需先登记具体道路范围；源灾损标签不等于业务障碍标签。",
      "image_file": "D:\\drone-agent-data\\p6-ai-verification-20261018\\ladi-pilot\\images\\1ca134b198cea5b0.jpg",
      "image_sha256": "329e09c465ceb95c440cbd4f63d72d5b34f6dfe45780a66fcd1bd085637594de"
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "ladi-e3fbb8fec558bb16",
      "original_viewed": true,
      "notes": "可见住宅旁横向道路及倒伏树木，中央倒树跨越道路，具备补充 vegetation 障碍候选的潜力。仍需独立目标标注、原分辨率轮廓核对和新上下文复核。",
      "image_file": "D:\\drone-agent-data\\p6-ai-verification-20261018\\ladi-pilot\\images\\e3fbb8fec558bb16.jpg",
      "image_sha256": "f6f9702bbdd892f10aef212ee5b3d38a1067d3bc4cbde1e936a17986a2f4c30a"
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "ladi-4edc890e38e04bfa",
      "notes": "海岸住宅区域多处屋面材料散落，部分材料接近道路；需要原分辨率道路边界核对，不能把路外灾损直接计作障碍。",
      "original_viewed": true,
      "image_file": "D:\\drone-agent-data\\p6-ai-verification-20261018\\ladi-pilot\\images\\4edc890e38e04bfa.jpg",
      "image_sha256": "2835177be4597ceefe4fdc8a29778059256b74f73fbc48058a8931a9d029e5ea"
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "ladi-a43871901f3458dc",
      "notes": "主体为机场跑道和滑行道，左侧可见拍摄飞机构件；不能把跑道直接改称园区道路正常样本。远处普通道路另需独立范围。",
      "original_viewed": true,
      "image_file": "D:\\drone-agent-data\\p6-ai-verification-20261018\\ladi-pilot\\images\\a43871901f3458dc.jpg",
      "image_sha256": "cddc0626af0eece65f62dfb9f327469c66ad42534e79628d384170318b136226"
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "ladi-cdb00f601de56e4c",
      "notes": "明显自然欠曝，仍可辨住宅道路，但较小实体和道路边缘难以确定；可作为质量不可判候选，不能据源类别判正常。",
      "original_viewed": true,
      "image_file": "D:\\drone-agent-data\\p6-ai-verification-20261018\\ladi-pilot\\images\\cdb00f601de56e4c.jpg",
      "image_sha256": "bb759eb08d4840f45ef96bfd0aa78511c4cac17c18e80ccde0facf0664487fdf"
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "ladi-08bb49c73cf2a54f",
      "notes": "主要为住宅庭院、草地、车辆和物资；没有完整明确的主要道路目标，不直接用庭院物资凑障碍样本。",
      "original_viewed": true,
      "image_file": "D:\\drone-agent-data\\p6-ai-verification-20261018\\ladi-pilot\\images\\08bb49c73cf2a54f.jpg",
